<title>USA: First Data's NTS to rollout debt card.</title>
<headline>First Data's NTS to rollout debt card.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Corp said its NTS unit would rollout a debt card product in April which would let businesses remit payroll, commission and expense reimbursement payments to employees faster.</p>
<p>The so-called TransPay card would help lower companies' costs by eliminating payments to employees by check, First Data said.</p>
<p>Employees with bank accounts could also make ATM withdrawals or transfer money into a savings or checking account, the company said.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-161</p>
